  "body": "$959k – Spacious Refreshed 4-Bed Home with Marina and Sea Views!\r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented 4-bedroom home offers incredible immediate value alongside its stunning sea and marina views.\r\n\r\nSTANDARD NZ LEGAL SALES PROCESS\r\nFor absolute peace of mind, the sale follows the standard New Zealand legal sales process through solicitors. We use the standard New Zealand Law Society Sale and Purchase Agreement, and both the buyer's and seller's solicitors will handle the paperwork as normal. Buyers are completely welcome to include standard finance, building report, or legal approval clauses with total confidence.\r\n\r\nImagine unwinding every day to spectacular, panoramic views over the Gulf Harbour Marina. If you want premium coastal living, solid construction, and effortless entertaining without a multi-million-dollar price tag, this is your opportunity. Enjoy stunning marina views from the lounge and dining room—a picturesque backdrop for entertaining or quiet evenings. For boat lovers, this property is a dream. Imagine waking up to marina views and spending weekends exploring the Hibiscus Coast and surrounding waterways. Come and experience the space, views, and lifestyle for yourself.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\nPANORAMIC MARINA & SEA VIEWS — Enjoy beautiful sea and marina vistas from the open-plan living area, balconies, and the upper master suite.\r\n\r\nVERSATILE 4-BEDROOM HOME — Ideal family layout, solid investment, or extra income potential.\r\n\r\nPERFECT MULTI-ZONE LIVING — Top-floor parents' master retreat features a large walk-in wardrobe and a relaxing spa bath, creating a private parents' sanctuary. With three additional double bedrooms, a family bathroom on the lower level, and good separation between spaces, the layout provides exceptional functionality and privacy for the whole family.\r\n\r\nREFRESHED, FULLY REPAINTED & MOVE-IN READY — The property has been refreshed inside and out using premium products designed to look great for years. The exterior features Dulux Weathershield painted durable solid brick veneer cavity based system and the interior is completely updated with Dulux Wash & Wear paint. Move straight in and relax! Enjoy modernised bathrooms and a guest toilet featuring brand-new vanities.\r\n\r\nTHE PRIVATE SALE ADVANTAGE — Deal directly with the owners for a transparent, hassle-free transaction. Viewings are also easily available by appointment to suit your schedule.\r\n\r\nONE HOME, THREE INCREDIBLE OPPORTUNITIES\r\nThis clever multi-level design adapts beautifully to your lifestyle or financial goals:\r\nFOR GROWING FAMILIES: Use the top floor as a dedicated parents' master retreat, keep the middle level for central family living, and leave the three downstairs double bedrooms as a separate zone for children, teenagers, or extended family.\r\n\r\nFOR PROFESSIONALS SEEKING EXTRA INCOME: With 3 double bedrooms, a full bathroom, and a sliding-door entrance to the garden on the ground floor, this layout offers excellent flexibility. The central mezzanine entry hall connects the floors openly, making the ground floor an ideal zone for boarders, extended family, or international students to generate additional income.\r\n\r\nFOR SMART INVESTORS: A low-maintenance addition to your portfolio. Its Gulf Harbour location, proximity to the ferry terminal, flexible multi-level layout, and panoramic views make it a highly attractive rental proposition.\r\n\r\nEASY-CARE OUTDOORS, PARKING & LOCATION\r\nSpend your weekends enjoying the peninsula rather than doing heavy yard work. Features a low-maintenance garden, secure double garage with internal access, double driveway parking, and extra off-street parking.\r\n\r\nAN IDEAL MIX OF LIFESTYLE & CONVENIENCE\r\nCOMMUTE: Minutes to the Gulf Harbour Ferry terminal for a relaxing cruise into the Auckland CBD, with local bus links nearby.\r\nLIFESTYLE: Close to local shops, cafés, restaurants, beautiful local beaches, and Shakespear Regional Park.\r\n\r\nPROPERTY DETAILS & COMPLIANCE\r\nQUALITY CONSTRUCTION: Well-maintained multi-level home with a tiled roof and solid durable brick veneer cavity-based exterior cladding system.\r\n\r\nCOMPLIANCE: Full Rodney District Council Code Compliance Certificate (CCC) issued in December 2006.\r\n\r\nLAND AREA: 312m2 freehold section.\r\n\r\nVIEWING & DOCUMENTATION\r\nTo help make things as easy as possible, a full property information pack is ready to be emailed to you upon request. This includes the Council Code Compliance Certificate (CCC), official council property records, and the architectural house plans.\r\n\r\nOpen homes scheduled weekly – times will be posted here. Private viewings are warmly welcome and easily available by appointment to suit your schedule. Feel free to text or call us directly to arrange a time that works for you.\r\n\r\nPRICE GUIDE — $959,000",
